<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-CLOSE OF PLAY SCORES IN RED STRIPE MATCHES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-CLOSE OF PLAY SCORES IN RED STRIPE MATCHES.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN, Barbados 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores</p>
<p>on the third day of four-day Red Stripe cricket matches:</p>
<p>In Port of Spain: Trinidad and Tobago 302; Windward Islands</p>
<p>140 and 283 (J.Silvester 66, B.Watt 57; Mukesh Persad 4-55).</p>
<p>In Bridgetown: Guyana 156 and 218-3 (C.Lambert 101 not out,</p>
<p>A.Percival 82 not out); Barbados 448-8 declared.</p>
<p>In Anguilla: Jamaica 332 (F.Rose 96, D.Morgan 63). Leeward</p>
<p>Islands</p>
<p>203-8.</p>
</text>
